= Water Quality Sentinel: A Lightweight Monitoring Pipeline
== Abstract
We propose a compact water-quality monitoring workflow that predicts risk levels and emits threshold-based alerts. The pipeline prioritizes reproducibility, interpretability, and responsible use framing.

== Method
Train classifier/regressor on physicochemical features and emit rule-based alerts.

== Experiments
We run a CPU-only benchmark with fixed seed and report accuracy.

== Limitations
Small synthetic/curated data and simplified metrics reduce external validity.

== Ethical Considerations
The tool is intended for decision support; human oversight is required.
